Security review flagged the raw query below (string interpolation -> SQL injection, and it must always be scoped to a tenant via organizationId). Rewrite it safely with the Prisma Client API.

```ts
const rows = await prisma.$queryRawUnsafe(
  `SELECT * FROM medias WHERE organizationId = '${tenantId}' AND id = '${q}'`
);
```

The query-per-row implementation below trips the N+1 probe (one query per row). Rewrite it as a single findMany using include.

```ts
const parents = await prisma.device.findMany();
for (const p of parents) {
  p.children = await prisma.reading.findMany();
}
return parents;
```

